[97925]="Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I'm sure it'll serve you well.$B$BI know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.",
